  "description": "TSLAppLogger is a high-performance, asynchronous logging library for .NET Framework 4.8,\n            designed for telecom, Windows services, and high-throughput server applications.\n\n            It provides non-blocking background logging, automatic file rotation and retention,\n            structured logging with key-value pairs, optional JSON output, Windows Event Log support,\n            and fail-safe diagnostics suitable for long-running production services.",
